# StreetPLM LightningAI Job — required secrets
# -----------------------------------------------
# Add these as Lightning AI Secrets in your teamspace:
#   pipeline-automation-project  →  Settings  →  Secrets
# The job reads them as environment variables at runtime.
# Never commit real values to version control.

# Google Maps Platform Street View Static API key
GOOGLE_STREETVIEW_API_KEY=<your_google_streetview_api_key>

# Hugging Face token — must have approved access to facebook/Perception-LM-1B
HF_TOKEN=<your_huggingface_token>

# GCP project ID with BigQuery API enabled (for querying Overture Maps)
GCP_PROJECT_ID=<your_gcp_project_id>

# Optional: override the default output directory
# Default: /teamspace/studios/this_studio/StreetPLM
# OUTPUT_DIR=/teamspace/studios/this_studio/StreetPLM

# Note: GCP / BigQuery auth uses Application Default Credentials (ADC).
# Run the following once in the Lightning AI terminal before submitting the job:
#   gcloud auth application-default login
